perf: Fix addr_filter_ranges lifetime

jira KERNEL-1773
cve CVE-2026-93817
Rebuild_History Non-Buildable kernel-4.18.0-553.176.1.el8_10
commit-author Peter Zijlstra <peterz@infradead.org>
